      "content": "hey so im type 2 and i started taking this new berberine supplement a couple days ago to help with my sugar levels. lately ive been feeling super thirsty like all the time and i feel like i have to pee every 20 mins or something lol. do u think the supplement is just making me dehydrated or is it something else?",
